&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.9pt;padding-right:2.9pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:7.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;樹脂・化成品、&lt;br/&gt;製紙用薬品&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2.9pt;padding-right:2.9pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:7.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;および電子材料&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:7.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;100.0&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:7.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社グループの樹脂・化成品、製紙用薬品、電子材料の販売および日本での製造会社であります。&lt;br/&gt;当社に対し債務保証を行っております。&lt;br/&gt;役員の兼任等…当社役員3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17pt;min-height:17pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.8pt;padding-right:2.3pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:7.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;  ハリマ化成商事㈱&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
